shape: sequence_diagram
mirror: EnginePlayer
engine: nori-engine thread
cache: media3 cache, OkHttp
track: nori-track writer

mirror -> engine: JNI doors: queueChanged, goTo, play
engine -> cache: open the song's bytes
cache -> engine: bytes, in bursts {style.stroke-dash: 4}
engine -> track: samples, through the ring
track -> track: AudioTrack.write, about every 10 s
engine -> mirror: events, then signal() {style.stroke-dash: 4}
